{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimal, elegant footer section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the uploaded reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact design reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different layout. Match the positioning, spacing, proportions, background, contact cards, typography and alignment.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width footer section.
    
    Background: warm ivory cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 45px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 45px.
    
    Minimal, premium, editorial aesthetic.
    
    All main brand content centred.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients, heavy shadows or decorative illustrations.
    
    2. CENTRED BRAND LOGO
    
    At the top centre, display the original Kiss & Kry logo.
    
    Use an editable Shopify image picker.
    
    Preserve the original logo artwork and proportions.
    
    Logo width: approximately 125px.
    
    Height: auto.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Maintain transparent background if available.
    
    Do not recreate or modify the logo using text.
    
    Below the logo, add the tagline:
    
    "Born from bamboo. Made for baby."
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: muted warm grey (#858575).
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Margin-top: 12px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 35px.
    
    3. FOUR CONTACT CARDS
    
    Create exactly FOUR equally sized horizontal contact cards in one row.
    
    Desktop layout:
    
    Four equal-width columns.
    
    Gap: 12px.
    
    Each card approximately 215px wide and 65px tall.
    
    Background: white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Border radius: 15px.
    
    No prominent border.
    
    Very subtle soft shadow.
    
    Internal horizontal padding: 15px.
    
    Vertically centre all content.
    
    Each card must contain:
    
    Circular olive icon background on the left.
    
    Small uppercase category label.
    
    Contact name or number below.
    
    Small diagonal arrow icon at the far right.
    
    CARD 1 – INSTAGRAM
    
    Icon:
    
    Instagram outline SVG.
    
    Circular background: muted olive (#626B4C).
    
    Icon colour: white.
    
    Circle size: 38px.
    
    Label:
    "INSTAGRAM"
    
    Main text:
    "@kissandkry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/
    
    CARD 2 – FACEBOOK
    
    Icon:
    
    Facebook SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "FACEBOOK"
    
    Main text:
    "Kiss & Kry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61563831763161
    
    CARD 3 – WHATSAPP
    
    Icon:
    
    WhatsApp outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "WHATSAPP"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    https://wa.me/919999738480
    
    CARD 4 – CALL US
    
    Icon:
    
    Telephone outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "CALL US"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    tel:+919999738480
    
    CONTACT CARD TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Category label:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    8px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 1.5px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Main contact text:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #555849.
    
    Arrow:
    
    Small northeast arrow.
    
    Colour: #A8AD91.
    
    Size: 12px.
    
    All four cards must have identical dimensions and alignment.
    
    Make each entire card clickable.
    
    4. CENTRED NAVIGATION MENU
    
    Below the four contact cards, create a single horizontally aligned navigation menu.
    
    Display exactly these six links:
    
    Shop
    
    Why bamboo
    
    Our story
    
    Reviews
    
    Care guide
    
    FAQ
    
    Styling:
    
    Horizontal layout.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Gap: 30px.
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    No background.
    
    No borders.
    
    No underline by default.
    
    Subtle colour transition on hover.
    
    Each navigation item must have an editable destination URL.
    
    5. BOTTOM FOOTER BAR
    
    Add a thin horizontal divider below the navigation.
    
    Divider:
    
    Width: 100%.
    
    Height: 1px.
    
    Colour: #E5E0D2.
    
    Margin-top: 35px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 20px.
    
    Create a bottom horizontal row with two aligned sections.
    
    LEFT – COPYRIGHT
    
    Text:
    
    "© 2026 Kiss & Kry. All rights reserved."
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    RIGHT – LEGAL LINKS
    
    Display four links in one horizontal row:
    
    Shipping policy
    
    Returns & refunds
    
    Privacy policy
    
    Terms of service
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Gap: 20px.
    
    Right aligned.
    
    No underline by default.
    
    Hover colour: #626B4C.
    
    Use Shopify's native policy URLs wherever available.
    
    6. EXACT COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use the following colours:
    
    Main background: #F5F3E7
    
    Contact card background: #FFFFFF
    
    Primary olive: #626B4C
    
    Secondary olive: #777D5D
    
    Main text: #555849
    
    Secondary text: #858575
    
    Divider: #E5E0D2
    
    Arrow icon: #A8AD91
    
    Preserve the original Kiss & Kry logo colours:
    
    Burgundy: #7C0504
    
    Terracotta: #93331D
    
    Golden Ochre: #C58C49
    
    Peach Gold: #F1B26D
    
    Do not recolour the uploaded logo.
    
    7. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat exclusively.
    
    Tagline: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Contact category labels: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Contact information: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Navigation: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Copyright: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Legal links: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Maintain consistent letter spacing and a premium typography hierarchy.
    
    , 8. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop
    
    Logo and tagline centred at the top.
    
    Four contact cards in one horizontal row.
    
    Six navigation links centred below.
    
    Copyright on the left.
    
    Legal links on the right.
    
    Tablet
    
    Four contact cards in a 2 × 2 grid if necessary.
    
    Navigation remains centred and can wrap.
    
    Maintain generous spacing.
    
    Mobile
    
    Logo centred at the top.
    
    Tagline directly below.
    
    Contact cards arranged in a 2 × 2 grid.
    
    Cards should occupy equal widths.
    
    Navigation links arranged in two or three compact rows.
    
    Bottom copyright centred.
    
    Legal links centred and allowed to wrap.
    
    Horizontal padding: 18px.
    
    Contact cards should remain compact and readable.
    
    No horizontal scrolling.
    
    9. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR FUNCTIONALITY
    
    Generate a complete, self-contained Shopify Liquid section.
    
    Include editable settings for:
    
    Brand logo image.
    
    Tagline.
    
    Instagram username and URL.
    
    Facebook page name and URL.
    
    WhatsApp number.
    
    Phone number.
    
    Contact card labels.
    
    Navigation menu links and destinations.
    
    Copyright text.
    
    Shipping policy URL.
    
    Returns policy URL.
    
    Privacy policy URL.
    
    Terms of service URL.
    
    Background colour.
    
    Card background colour.
    
    Icon background colour.
    
    Text colours.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Card spacing.
    
    Border radius.
    
    Use Shopify image_picker for the logo.
    
    Use inline SVG icons for Instagram, Facebook, WhatsApp, telephone and arrows.
    
    Make all contact cards functional.
    
    Use semantic HTML, clean CSS and lightweight JavaScript only where required.
    
    Ensure compatibility with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Do not modify any other theme sections.
    
    10. FINAL NON-NEGOTIABLE REQUIREMENTS
    
    The uploaded screenshot is the exact visual specification.
    
    Prioritise:
    
    Warm cream background.
    
    Original Kiss & Kry logo centred at the top.
    
    Tagline underneath.
    
    Exactly four white contact cards in one row on desktop.
    
    Olive circular icons.
    
    Contact labels and information.
    
    Small arrow icons on the right of each card.
    
    Six centred navigation links.
    
    Thin horizontal divider.
    
    Copyright on the bottom-left.
    
    Four legal links on the bottom-right.
    
    Montserrat typography.
    
    Do not add:
    
    Newsletter forms.
    
    Extra navigation columns.
    
    Large social media sections.
    
    Payment badges.
    
    Additional illustrations.
    
    Promotional banners.
    
    Unnecessary animations.
    
    Dark backgrounds.
    
    FINAL RESULT: Recreate the uploaded screenshot as accurately as possible. The footer must be simple, elegant, balanced and premium, with the original Kiss & Kry branding taking centre stage.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;padding:{{ block.settings.vertical_padding }}px 18px;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},Montserrat,sans-serif}.ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}.ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}.ai-kry-footer__brand-{{ ai_gen_id }}{text-align:center}.ai-kry-footer__logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:125px;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto}.ai-kry-footer__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:125px;height:70px;margin:0 auto}.ai-kry-footer__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg{width:100%;height:100%}.ai-kry-footer__tagline-{{ ai_gen_id }}{margin:12px 0 35px;color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}.ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:{{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px}.ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-width:0;min-height:65px;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:{{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;background:{{ block.settings.card_background }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 9px rgba(69,65,45,.07)}.ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;flex:0 0 38px;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.icon_background }};color:#fff}.ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} .facebook-path{fill:currentColor;stroke:none}.ai-kry-footer__copy-{{ ai_gen_id }}{min-width:0;flex:1}.ai-kry-footer__label-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};font-size:8px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-kry-footer__value-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;overflow:hidden;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};font-size:11px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}.ai-kry-footer__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}{flex:0 0 auto;color:{{ block.settings.arrow_color }}}.ai-kry-footer__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px 30px;margin-top:30px}.ai-kry-footer__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} a{color:{{ block.settings.primary_color }};font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}.ai-kry-footer__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover{color:{{ block.settings.secondary_olive }}}.ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:18px;border-top:1px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};margin-top:35px;padding-top:20px}.ai-kry-footer__copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }},.ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a{color:{{ block.settings.secondary_text_color }};font-size:9px;line-height:1.5}.ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 20px}.ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a{text-decoration:none}.ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover{color:{{ block.settings.primary_color }}}@media(max-width:900px){.ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }}{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding-right:18px;padding-left:18px}.ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:100%}.ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }}{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:9px;gap:8px}.ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:34px;height:34px;flex-basis:34px}.ai-kry-footer__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}{gap:12px 22px;margin-top:25px}.ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}{align-items:center;flex-direction:column;text-align:center}.ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}{justify-content:center;gap:8px 16px}}
{% endstyle %}
<footer class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><div class="ai-kry-footer__brand-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% if block.settings.logo != blank %}<img class="ai-kry-footer__logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}" src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.logo.alt | default: shop.name | escape }}" width="125" height="{{ block.settings.logo.height | times: 125 | divided_by: block.settings.logo.width }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-kry-footer__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}<p class="ai-kry-footer__tagline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tagline | escape }}</p></div>
<div class="ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% liquid
assign label_key = 'contact_' | append: i | append: '_label'
assign value_key = 'contact_' | append: i | append: '_value'
assign url_key = 'contact_' | append: i | append: '_url'
assign label_value = block.settings[label_key]
assign contact_value = block.settings[value_key]
assign contact_url = block.settings[url_key]
%}<a class="ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ contact_url | escape }}" {% if i < 3 %}target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %} aria-label="{{ label_value | escape }}: {{ contact_value | escape }}"><span class="ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true">{% case i %}{% when 1 %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.6" cy="6.6" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg>{% when 2 %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path class="facebook-path" d="M13.6 21v-8h2.7l.4-3.1h-3.1v-2c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.7V3.6c-.3 0-1.3-.1-2.5-.1-2.5 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3v2.1H7.4V13h2.8v8z"/></svg>{% when 3 %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.2 11.7a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-12.1 7.2L3 20l1.2-4.9a8.2 8.2 0 1 1 16-3.4z"/><path d="M8.2 7.8c.2-.4.4-.4.7-.4h.4c.2 0 .3.1.4.4l.7 1.6c.1.2 0 .4-.1.6l-.5.6c-.2.2-.2.4 0 .6.5.9 1.2 1.6 2.1 2.1.2.1.4.1.6-.1l.7-.8c.2-.2.4-.2.6-.1l1.5.7c.2.1.3.2.3.4 0 .3-.2 1.1-.6 1.4-.4.4-1 .6-1.7.5-1-.1-2.2-.7-3.6-1.9-1.6-1.4-2.6-3.1-2.8-4.1-.2-.8.1-1.3.3-1.5z"/></svg>{% when 4 %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3.8 9.8 7l-1.7 2.2a14.2 14.2 0 0 0 6.7 6.7l2.2-1.7 3.2 2.8-.8 3c-.2.7-.9 1.1-1.6 1C9.9 19.8 4.2 14.1 3 6.2c-.1-.7.3-1.4 1-1.6L7 3.8z"/></svg>{% endcase %}</span><span class="ai-kry-footer__copy-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><span class="ai-kry-footer__label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ label_value | escape }}</span><span class="ai-kry-footer__value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ contact_value | escape }}</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endfor %}</div>
<nav class="ai-kry-footer__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Footer navigation">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign nav_label_key = 'nav_' | append: i | append: '_label'
assign nav_url_key = 'nav_' | append: i | append: '_url'
assign nav_label = block.settings[nav_label_key]
assign nav_url = block.settings[nav_url_key]
%}<a href="{{ nav_url | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ nav_label | escape }}</a>{% endfor %}</nav>
<div class="ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><span class="ai-kry-footer__copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.copyright | escape }}</span><nav class="ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Legal links"><a href="{{ block.settings.shipping_url | default: shop.shipping_policy.url | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ block.settings.shipping_label | escape }}</a><a href="{{ block.settings.returns_url | default: shop.refund_policy.url | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ block.settings.returns_label | escape }}</a><a href="{{ block.settings.privacy_url | default: shop.privacy_policy.url | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ block.settings.privacy_label | escape }}</a><a href="{{ block.settings.terms_url | default: shop.terms_of_service.url | default: routes.root_url }}">{{ block.settings.terms_label | escape }}</a></nav></div></div></footer>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Kiss & Kry footer","settings":[{"type":"image_picker","id":"logo","label":"Brand logo"},{"type":"text","id":"tagline","label":"Tagline","default":"Born from bamboo. Made for baby."},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"range","id":"vertical_padding","label":"Vertical padding","min":20,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":45},{"type":"header","content":"Contact cards"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_1_label","label":"Instagram label","default":"Instagram"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_1_value","label":"Instagram username","default":"@kissandkry"},{"type":"url","id":"contact_1_url","label":"Instagram URL"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_2_label","label":"Facebook label","default":"Facebook"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_2_value","label":"Facebook page name","default":"Kiss & Kry"},{"type":"url","id":"contact_2_url","label":"Facebook URL"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_3_label","label":"WhatsApp label","default":"WhatsApp"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_3_value","label":"WhatsApp number","default":"+91 99997 38480"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_3_url","label":"WhatsApp link","default":"https://wa.me/919999738480"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_4_label","label":"Call label","default":"Call us"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_4_value","label":"Phone number","default":"+91 99997 38480"},{"type":"text","id":"contact_4_url","label":"Phone link","default":"tel:+919999738480"},{"type":"range","id":"card_spacing","label":"Card spacing","min":4,"max":24,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":12},{"type":"range","id":"card_radius","label":"Card radius","min":0,"max":30,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},{"type":"header","content":"Navigation menu"},{"type":"text","id":"nav_1_label","label":"Link 1 label","default":"Shop"},{"type":"url","id":"nav_1_url","label":"Link 1 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"nav_2_label","label":"Link 2 label","default":"Why bamboo"},{"type":"url","id":"nav_2_url","label":"Link 2 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"nav_3_label","label":"Link 3 label","default":"Our story"},{"type":"url","id":"nav_3_url","label":"Link 3 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"nav_4_label","label":"Link 4 label","default":"Reviews"},{"type":"url","id":"nav_4_url","label":"Link 4 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"nav_5_label","label":"Link 5 label","default":"Care guide"},{"type":"url","id":"nav_5_url","label":"Link 5 destination"},{"type":"text","id":"nav_6_label","label":"Link 6 label","default":"FAQ"},{"type":"url","id":"nav_6_url","label":"Link 6 destination"},{"type":"header","content":"Copyright and policies"},{"type":"text","id":"copyright","label":"Copyright text","default":"© 2026 Kiss & Kry. All rights reserved."},{"type":"text","id":"shipping_label","label":"Shipping link label","default":"Shipping policy"},{"type":"url","id":"shipping_url","label":"Shipping policy URL"},{"type":"text","id":"returns_label","label":"Returns link label","default":"Returns & refunds"},{"type":"url","id":"returns_url","label":"Returns policy URL"},{"type":"text","id":"privacy_label","label":"Privacy link label","default":"Privacy policy"},{"type":"url","id":"privacy_url","label":"Privacy policy URL"},{"type":"text","id":"terms_label","label":"Terms link label","default":"Terms of service"},{"type":"url","id":"terms_url","label":"Terms of service URL"},{"type":"header","content":"Colors"},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#F5F3E7"},{"type":"color","id":"card_background","label":"Card background","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"color","id":"icon_background","label":"Icon background","default":"#626B4C"},{"type":"color","id":"primary_color","label":"Primary olive","default":"#626B4C"},{"type":"color","id":"secondary_olive","label":"Secondary olive","default":"#777D5D"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text","default":"#555849"},{"type":"color","id":"secondary_text_color","label":"Secondary text","default":"#858575"},{"type":"color","id":"divider_color","label":"Divider","default":"#E5E0D2"},{"type":"color","id":"arrow_color","label":"Arrow","default":"#A8AD91"}],"presets":[{"name":"Kiss & Kry footer"}],"tag":null,"class":"kiss-and-kry-footer-block"}
{% endschema %}